    "qualifierLines": [
      "{**28 NY3d at 347} OPINION OF THE COURT",
      " I would reverse defendant's conviction because the court assumed the jury's fact-finding role and{**28 NY3d at 350} mistakenly denied defendant's request for a lesser included offense charge. The majority's adherence to People v Eboli (34 NY2d 281 [1974]) and People v Discala (45 NY2d 38 [1978]) in support of the proposition that a judge, and not the jury, determines whether defendant's conduct was not of a \"heinous quality\" perpetuates an error in our law. Therefore, I dissent."
    ],
